  <summary>Manage your Docker containers</summary>
  <summary xml:lang="pt-BR">Gerencie seus containers Docker</summary>
  <description>
    <p>doknyu is a fast, keyboard-friendly desktop app to manage Docker containers, logs, stats, volumes and networks, with an embedded terminal for each container.</p>
    <p xml:lang="pt-BR">doknyu é um app desktop rápido e amigável ao teclado para gerenciar containers, logs, estatísticas, volumes e redes do Docker, com um terminal embutido para cada container.</p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.rafaelprofmgz.Doknyu.desktop</launchable>
  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/RafaelProfMgz/doknyu</url>
  <url type="bugtracker">https://github.com/RafaelProfMgz/doknyu/issues</url>
